  ('admit-1789384001858', 'app-1789377144808', 'GK26-10006', '26119925', 'satvik', 'FatherName', 'Class 11 Science', 'Gurukul Kurukshetra Main Campus', 'Near 3rd Gate, Kurukshetra University, Kurukshetra, Haryana - 136119', '06 December 2026', '08:30 AM', '10:00 AM to 12:30 PM (2.5 Hours)', 'Hall-A, Desk 34', 'data:image/jpeg;base64,', 1, '["Bring printed copy of this Admit Card along with original Aadhaar Card.","Candidates must arrive at least 45 minutes prior to the examination time.","Electronic gadgets, smart watches, and calculators are strictly prohibited.","Blue/Black ballpoint pens only to be used for OMR / answer sheets."]', '2026-09-14T11:06:41.858Z'),
